  title: A LETTER WITHOUT A SEAL
  description: 'My Pontiff, a courier left a letter at our door and vanished into
    the crowd. It names three magistrates who visit a certain house in the Pink Quarter,
    with the dates of each visit. Knowledge like this is a blade without a handle:
    it cuts whoever holds it.'
